1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:09,480
Nowadays, many college students stay up late, skip breakfast and spend hours sitting in front of screens.
如今，许多大学生熬夜、不吃早饭，还一连几个小时坐在屏幕前。

2
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:15,950
These habits may seem harmless at first, but over time they can seriously damage students’ health.
这些习惯起初看似无害，但久而久之会严重损害学生的健康。

3
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:21,260
Therefore, it is important for college students to develop a healthy lifestyle.
因此，大学生养成健康的生活方式非常重要。

4
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:26,630
A healthy lifestyle is, first of all, the basis of a strong body.
首先，健康的生活方式是强健身体的基础。

5
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:34,620
Eating balanced meals, getting enough sleep and exercising regularly help students stay energetic and resist illness.
饮食均衡、睡眠充足、规律锻炼，能帮助学生保持精力充沛，抵御疾病。

6
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:38,150
In addition, it benefits their studies.
此外，它对学习也有好处。

7
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:45,820
A well-rested mind learns faster and remembers more, so students with good habits often perform better in class.
休息充分的头脑学得更快、记得更多，所以习惯良好的学生往往在课堂上表现更好。

8
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:50,280
What is more, a healthy lifestyle is good for mental health.
更重要的是，健康的生活方式有益于心理健康。

9
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:57,240
Regular exercise and a stable daily routine can relieve stress and keep students in a positive mood.
规律的锻炼和稳定的日常作息可以缓解压力，让学生保持积极的心情。

10
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:05,070
To develop such a lifestyle, students should keep a regular schedule, limit their screen time and take part in sports.
要养成这样的生活方式，学生应该作息规律，限制看屏幕的时间，并参加体育运动。

11
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:13,260
Habits formed at college often last a lifetime, so starting now is one of the best investments students can make in their future.
大学时养成的习惯往往会保持一生，所以从现在做起，是学生对自己的未来所能做的最好的投资之一。
